    <title>06. 香港城市美学：只有散步，我们才真正聊天</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67eebbfbf9578163d6e40112</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67eebbfbf9578163d6e40112</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 04 Apr 2025 02:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>📝 关键词：</span><br><span>港风｜港乐｜​城市散步学｜城市更新｜城市美学｜风水玄学</span></p><span></span><p><span>也许没有哪个地区的文艺作品会像香港那样，它既有马华文学的咸湿，也因为它富足而又逼仄的环境‚使城市本身成了创作者乐此不疲的诉求对象 。香港不单是一个空间能指，更是一个文化语境。教堂与庙宇林立、除夕与圣诞同在，甚至婚丧嫁娶之中也是中西并存。</span></p><span></span><p><span>⌚️ 时间线：</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="39">00:39</a> 香港城市散步学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="77">01:17</a> 文艺b的圣地巡礼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="171">02:51</a> 菲佣周日：被社交平台过滤的日常</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="268">04:28</a> 港风滤镜：从胶片美学到社交表演</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="416">06:56</a> 艺术向下，生活向上：城市更新与保育</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="903">15:03</a> 城市公共设施</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1223">20:23</a> 从《过春天》到香港校服</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1712">28:32</a> 风水玄学与都市传说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1894">31:34</a> 在地性叙事</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>小红书：呼大鸭 &amp; 大鸭宇宙</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>公众号：大鸭宇宙</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>微博：某种牙</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>联系我们️： 微信 RealHoo31 添加小助理，欢迎加入听友群</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmahSH9ZLhx6zIvCpwVMb0qV0ANC.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>* 纸皮石 &amp; 港铁宋体</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr0hv32eYxVaZCfzpXtXawUPpI4d.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>* 等线黑体的一种——用锣针推出来的“锣机体”</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmT1ZRa9wv31FDQU7iBYZwPgCuUQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>* 朝廷语气的告示</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgoKUVKCDQzRypY_Fmybx_ExXmRd.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>* 水磨石</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://im